Q.
Nondiscrimination. The Consultant shall comply with the Civil Rights Act of
1964, the Wyoming Fair Employment Practices Act (Wyo. Stat. § 27-9-105, et
seq.), the Americans With Disabilities Act (ADA), 42 U.S.C. § 12101, et seq., the
